### 查询活动列表
GET http://localhost:18082/api/events

### Redis 模式下抢一张票
POST http://localhost:18082/api/orders/grab
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 200,
  "sessionId": 101,
  "ticketCategoryId": 1001
}

### 同一用户重复抢同一场次同一票种，预期返回 400
POST http://localhost:18082/api/orders/grab
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 200,
  "sessionId": 101,
  "ticketCategoryId": 1001
}
